[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14160.189, "timestamp": "03:56:00", "text": "对其他人来说，情况的确如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14164.269, "timestamp": "03:56:04", "text": "起初并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14169.79, "timestamp": "03:56:09", "text": "说实话，到目前为止我还没做什么特别的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14173.99, "timestamp": "03:56:13", "text": "成为救世主的愿望最终源于你自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14177.269, "timestamp": "03:56:17", "text": "那只不过是仿制品而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14178.99, "timestamp": "03:56:18", "text": "但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14182.95, "timestamp": "03:56:22", "text": "死后，当你拥有太多空闲时间时，你就不会意识到这一点了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14186.63, "timestamp": "03:56:26", "text": "这样的存在。更多明星"}]